  <div class="lang" role="group" aria-label="Langue / Language"><svg class="globe" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><ellipse class="mer" cx="12" cy="12" rx="4.2" ry="9"/><ellipse class="mer m2" cx="12" cy="12" rx="4.2" ry="9"/><path d="M3.2 12h17.6M5 7.6h14M5 16.4h14"/></svg><span class="pill" aria-hidden="true"></span><label for="dvl-fr" class="lb" data-l="fr" aria-pressed="true">FR</label><label for="dvl-en" class="lb" data-l="en" aria-pressed="false">EN</label></div>
</header>

<main>
<section class="studio" id="studio" aria-label="Studio Diamond Vision en 3D">
  <div class="view" aria-hidden="true"><div class="par" id="par"><img id="bake" alt=""><canvas id="scene"></canvas><div class="pdia"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div></div><div class="shade"></div></div>
  <div class="doors" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="door l"><b>DIAMOND</b><small><span class="i-fr">BOÎTE DE</span><span class="i-en">PRODUCTION</span></small></div>
    <div class="door r"><b>VISION</b><small><span class="i-fr">PRODUCTION</span><span class="i-en">COMPANY</span></small></div>
  </div>
  <div class="hud" aria-hidden="true">
    <span class="corner c1"></span><span class="corner c2"></span><span class="corner c3"></span><span class="corner c4"></span>
    <div class="spec">4K UHD · 3840×2160<br><span class="i-fr">120 IPS · ISO 800</span><span class="i-en">120 FPS · ISO 800</span></div>
  </div>
  <div class="slate">
    <div class="eyebrow">Boîte de production vidéo &amp; web</div>
    <h1><span class="i-fr">Votre image, taillée comme</span><span class="i-en">Your image, cut like</span> <em><span class="i-fr">un diamant.</span><span class="i-en">a diamond.</span></em></h1>
    <p><span class="i-fr">Vidéos publicitaires 4K, du tournage au montage final, et sites internet optimisés pour faire grandir votre entreprise.</span><span class="i-en">4K promotional videos, from filming to final edit, and optimized websites to help your business grow.</span></p>
    <div class="actions">
      <a class="btn primary" href="#contact"><span class="i-fr">Lancer mon projet</span><span class="i-en">Start my project</span></a>
      <a class="btn ghost" href="#services"><span class="i-fr">Nos services</span><span class="i-en">Our services</span></a>
    </div>
  </div>
  <button class="skip" id="skip" type="button"><span class="i-fr">Passer l'entrée</span><span class="i-en">Skip intro</span></button>
</section>

<section class="room marble" id="services">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="head">
      <div class="facet"><i></i><b></b></div>
      <span class="eyebrow"><span class="i-fr">Production vidéo</span><span class="i-en">Video production</span></span>
      <h2><span class="i-fr">Des vidéos qui font briller votre marque</span><span class="i-en">Videos that make your brand shine</span></h2>
      <p><span class="i-fr">On s'occupe de tout, de l'idée jusqu'au fichier final, pour que votre produit ou votre commerce soit vu sous son meilleur angle.</span><span class="i-en">We handle everything, from the idea to the final file, so your product or business is seen from its best angle.</span></p>
    </div>
    <div class="split">
      <article class="card"><span class="tag"><span class="i-fr">Caméra 4K · son pro</span><span class="i-en">4K camera · pro sound</span></span><h3><span class="i-fr">Tournage 4K</span><span class="i-en">4K filming</span></h3><p><span class="i-fr">Des images nettes et cinématographiques, captées avec une caméra 4K et du matériel audio de qualité, pour que chaque détail de votre produit ou de votre entreprise ressorte.</span><span class="i-en">Sharp, cinematic footage captured with a 4K camera and quality audio gear, so every detail of your product or business stands out.</span></p></article>
      <article class="card"><span class="tag">Adobe Premiere Pro</span><h3><span class="i-fr">Montage Premiere Pro</span><span class="i-en">Premiere Pro editing</span></h3><p><span class="i-fr">Rythme, étalonnage des couleurs, son et animation : un montage professionnel réalisé dans Premiere Pro pour un rendu soigné du début à la fin.</span><span class="i-en">Pacing, color grading, sound and animation: a professional edit made in Premiere Pro for a polished result from start to finish.</span></p></article>
      <article class="card"><span class="tag"><span class="i-fr">Clé en main</span><span class="i-en">Turnkey</span></span><h3><span class="i-fr">De A à Z</span><span class="i-en">A to Z</span></h3><p><span class="i-fr">Concept, tournage, montage et livraison : notre équipe gère toutes les étapes. Vous n'avez qu'à approuver le résultat.</span><span class="i-en">Concept, filming, editing and delivery: our team handles every step. All you have to do is approve the result.</span></p></article>
    </div>
    <div class="steps" aria-label="Notre processus">
      <div class="step"><span class="n">01</span><strong>Concept</strong><span><span class="i-fr">On définit votre message et l'histoire à raconter.</span><span class="i-en">We define your message and the story to tell.</span></span></div>
      <div class="step"><span class="n">02</span><strong><span class="i-fr">Tournage</span><span class="i-en">Filming</span></strong><span><span class="i-fr">On filme en 4K, chez vous ou en studio.</span><span class="i-en">We shoot in 4K, at your place or in the studio.</span></span></div>
      <div class="step"><span class="n">03</span><strong><span class="i-fr">Montage</span><span class="i-en">Editing</span></strong><span><span class="i-fr">Couleur, son et rythme dans Premiere Pro.</span><span class="i-en">Color, sound and pacing in Premiere Pro.</span></span></div>
      <div class="step"><span class="n">04</span><strong><span class="i-fr">Livraison</span><span class="i-en">Delivery</span></strong><span><span class="i-fr">Des formats prêts pour le web et les réseaux.</span><span class="i-en">Formats ready for the web and social media.</span></span></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="room ice" id="web">
  <div class="wrap web">
    <div>
      <div class="head">
        <div class="facet"><i></i><b></b></div>
        <span class="eyebrow"><span class="i-fr">Création de sites internet</span><span class="i-en">Website design</span></span>
        <h2><span class="i-fr">Des sites internet optimisés pour tout type de business</span><span class="i-en">Optimized websites for every type of business</span></h2>
        <p><span class="i-fr">Restaurant, salon, entrepreneur ou boutique : on conçoit un site à votre image, pensé pour être trouvé, rapide à charger et facile à utiliser.</span><span class="i-en">Restaurant, salon, contractor or shop: we design a site that reflects you, built to be found, fast to load and easy to use.</span></p>
      </div>
      <ul class="checks">
        <li><span><strong><span class="i-fr">Rapide et parfait sur cellulaire</span><span class="i-en">Fast and perfect on mobile</span></strong><span class="i-fr">Un site léger qui s'affiche en un instant sur téléphone, tablette et ordinateur.</span><span class="i-en">A lightweight site that loads instantly on phone, tablet and computer.</span></span></li>
        <li><span><strong><span class="i-fr">Trouvé sur Google</span><span class="i-en">Found on Google</span></strong><span class="i-fr">Référencement local, titres et descriptions optimisés pour que vos clients vous trouvent près de chez eux.</span><span class="i-en">Local SEO, optimized titles and descriptions so customers find you close to home.</span></span></li>
        <li><span><strong><span class="i-fr">Pensé pour convertir</span><span class="i-en">Built to convert</span></strong><span class="i-fr">Boutons d'appel, formulaires et prise de rendez-vous placés là où vos clients en ont besoin.</span><span class="i-en">Call buttons, forms and booking placed exactly where your customers need them.</span></span></li>
        <li><span><strong><span class="i-fr">Vos vidéos mises en valeur</span><span class="i-en">Your videos in the spotlight</span></strong><span class="i-fr">Vos contenus 4K intégrés directement au site pour un impact maximal.</span><span class="i-en">Your 4K content built right into the site for maximum impact.</span></span></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="browser" aria-label="Exemple de résultats de performance d'un site">
      <div class="bar"><i></i><i></i><i></i><code>votre-entreprise.ca</code></div>
      <div class="score" id="gauges"></div>
      <div class="biz" aria-label="Types d'entreprises">
        <span>Restaurants</span><span>Salons &amp; spas</span><span>Construction</span><span><span class="i-fr">Commerces de détail</span><span class="i-en">Retail stores</span></span><span><span class="i-fr">Cliniques</span><span class="i-en">Clinics</span></span><span>Artisans</span><span><span class="i-fr">Immobilier</span><span class="i-en">Real estate</span></span><span><span class="i-fr">OBNL</span><span class="i-en">Nonprofits</span></span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="room marble" id="local">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="head">
      <div class="facet"><i></i><b></b></div>
      <span class="eyebrow"><span class="i-fr">Fiers d'ici</span><span class="i-en">Proudly local</span></span>
      <h2><span class="i-fr">On aime aider nos entreprises locales</span><span class="i-en">We love helping our local businesses</span></h2>
      <p><span class="i-fr">Nos voisins, nos commerçants et nos entrepreneurs font vivre notre communauté. Les aider à rayonner, c'est ce qui nous motive chaque jour.</span><span class="i-en">Our neighbours, merchants and entrepreneurs keep our community alive. Helping them shine is what drives us every day.</span></p>
    </div>
    <div class="local">
      <div><h3><span class="i-fr">On se rencontre en personne</span><span class="i-en">We meet in person</span></h3><p><span class="i-fr">On vient voir votre commerce, on comprend votre réalité et on filme sur place.</span><span class="i-en">We visit your business, understand your reality and film on site.</span></p></div>
      <div><h3><span class="i-fr">Des prix pensés pour les PME</span><span class="i-en">Prices designed for small businesses</span></h3><p><span class="i-fr">Des forfaits adaptés aux petites et moyennes entreprises, sans frais cachés.</span><span class="i-en">Packages tailored to small and medium businesses, with no hidden fees.</span></p></div>
      <div><h3><span class="i-fr">Un partenaire à long terme</span><span class="i-en">A long-term partner</span></h3><p><span class="i-fr">Mises à jour du site, nouvelles vidéos, conseils : on reste là après le lancement.</span><span class="i-en">Site updates, new videos, advice: we're still here after launch.</span></p></div>
    </div>
    <p class="quote"><span class="i-fr">« Quand une entreprise d'ici gagne en visibilité, c'est toute la communauté qui brille. »</span><span class="i-en">“When a local business gains visibility, the whole community shines.”</span></p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="room platinum" id="apropos">
  <div class="wrap about">
    <div class="head" style="margin-bottom:0">
      <div class="facet"><i></i><b></b></div>
      <span class="eyebrow"><span class="i-fr">Qui sommes-nous</span><span class="i-en">Who we are</span></span>
      <h2><span class="i-fr">Deux jeunes entrepreneurs passionnés de communication</span><span class="i-en">Two young entrepreneurs passionate about communication</span></h2>
      <p><span class="i-fr">On réfléchit d'abord à ce que votre message doit dire, puis à la meilleure façon de le montrer. On met notre expertise au service de chaque projet et de chaque client, en vidéo comme sur le web.</span><span class="i-en">We first think about what your message needs to say, then about the best way to show it. We put our expertise to work for every project and every client, on video and on the web.</span></p>
    </div>
    <div class="stats">
      <div class="stat"><b><span class="i-fr">5 ans</span><span class="i-en">5 years</span></b><span><span class="i-fr">d'expérience en montage vidéo</span><span class="i-en">of video editing experience</span></span></div>
      <div class="stat"><b>4K</b><span><span class="i-fr">de qualité d'image sur chaque tournage</span><span class="i-en">image quality on every shoot</span></span></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="room ice contact" id="contact">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="head">
      <div class="facet"><i></i><b></b></div>
      <span class="eyebrow">Contact</span>
      <h2><span class="i-fr">Parlons de votre projet</span><span class="i-en">Let's talk about your project</span></h2>
      <p><span class="i-fr">Vidéo, site internet ou les deux : décrivez-nous votre idée et recevez une proposition sur mesure.</span><span class="i-en">Video, website or both: tell us your idea and get a custom proposal.</span></p>
    </div>
    <div class="lines">
      <div class="line"><a href="mailto:diamondvision450@gmail.com">diamondvision450@gmail.com</a><button class="copy" type="button" data-copy="diamondvision450@gmail.com"><span class="i-fr">Copier</span><span class="i-en">Copy</span></button></div>
      <div class="line"><a href="tel:+15818995974">581-899-5974</a><button class="copy" type="button" data-copy="581-899-5974"><span class="i-fr">Copier</span><span class="i-en">Copy</span></button></div>
